    ('admin.mail.marketing.hint.bounce.tail', 'zh-CN', '会标记失败并把地址加入抑制名单（再发只会继续伤域名声誉）；配置类错误（密码 / 端口）直接标失败不重试。', 200, 'admin', 'admin/mail_marketing.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.mail.marketing.hint.bounce.tail', 'en-US', ' are marked failed and the address is added to the suppression list (sending again would only damage the domain''s reputation); configuration errors (password / port) are marked failed without retrying.', 200, 'admin', 'admin/mail_marketing.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.mail.marketing.hint.consent.lead', 'zh-CN', '群发', 200, 'admin', 'admin/mail_marketing.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.mail.marketing.hint.consent.lead', 'en-US', 'Campaigns go ', 200, 'admin', 'admin/mail_marketing.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.mail.marketing.hint.consent.mid', 'zh-CN', '。未确认同意的联系人（待确认）不会被发送 —— 未经同意就群发，收件方会标记垃圾邮件，发信域名的声誉会被打烂，之后连注册验证邮件都进垃圾箱。所以导入时问的「这批人是否已同意」不是走形式，而是', 200, 'admin', 'admin/mail_marketing.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.mail.marketing.hint.consent.mid', 'en-US', '. Contacts without confirmed consent (pending) are never sent to — sending without consent gets the recipient to mark it as spam, wrecks the sending domain''s reputation and eventually puts even verification emails in the spam folder. That is why the question asked during import, "has this list consented", is not a formality: it ', 200, 'admin', 'admin/mail_marketing.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.mail.marketing.hint.consent.strong', 'zh-CN', '只发给「已订阅」的人', 200, 'admin', 'admin/mail_marketing.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.mail.marketing.hint.consent.strong', 'en-US', 'only to people marked "subscribed"', 200, 'admin', 'admin/mail_marketing.html', 1, now(), now()),
