    ('admin.mail.marketing.start_hint.strong', 'en-US', 'accepting the job', 200, 'admin', 'admin/mail_marketing.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.mail.marketing.start_hint.tail', 'zh-CN', '而不是同步发完：目标人数上万时，一次入队几万个任务会让请求挂住、内存膨胀，中途失败还会留下「一半已入队」的残缺状态。所以启动只统计人数、改状态、入队一个展开任务，收件人在后台按主键游标分批展开。启动后刷新本页即可看到进度。', 200, 'admin', 'admin/mail_marketing.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.mail.marketing.start_hint.tail', 'en-US', ', not sending it all synchronously: with tens of thousands of recipients, enqueuing every task at once would hang the request and balloon memory, and a failure halfway through would leave a half-enqueued state behind. So starting only counts the recipients, flips the status and enqueues one expansion task; recipients are paged by primary-key cursor in the background. Refresh this page to see the progress.', 200, 'admin', 'admin/mail_marketing.html', 1, now(), now()),
