    ('admin.returns.hint.flow.mid', 'zh-CN', '。「入库」是把货加回库存（原因字典里的退货入库），', 200, 'admin', 'admin/returns.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.returns.hint.flow.mid', 'en-US', '. "Restock" puts the goods back into inventory (the return-to-stock reason in the reason dictionary), and ', 200, 'admin', 'admin/returns.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.returns.hint.flow.mid2', 'zh-CN', '。顺序不能反 —— 反过来就是「钱退了、货没回来」，这是退货流程最容易被薅的地方，所以这个页面', 200, 'admin', 'admin/returns.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.returns.hint.flow.mid2', 'en-US', '. The order cannot be reversed — doing it the other way round means "the money is refunded but the goods never came back", which is the most abused spot in any return flow, so this page has ', 200, 'admin', 'admin/returns.html', 1, now(), now()),
