    ('admin.returns.hint.status.lead', 'zh-CN', '状态：待审核 → 已同意待收货 → 已入库待退款 → 已完成；已拒绝 / 已撤销是终态。现实里货往往早就到了（客户先联系客服、客服再走系统），所以「同意」时可以勾选', 200, 'admin', 'admin/returns.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.returns.hint.status.lead', 'en-US', 'Statuses: pending review → approved, awaiting goods → restocked, awaiting refund → completed; rejected / withdrawn are terminal. In practice the goods often arrive long before anyone touches the system (the customer contacts support first, support then uses the admin), so when approving you can tick ', 200, 'admin', 'admin/returns.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.returns.hint.status.strong_auto', 'zh-CN', '同意并立即完成入库 + 退款', 200, 'admin', 'admin/returns.html', 1, now(), now()),
