    ('admin.returns.hint.status.tail', 'zh-CN', '（一步到底）。「已入库待退款」是退款那一步没做完（通道抖动 / 网络断了）留下的状态，补退款即可，不会重复入库。', 200, 'admin', 'admin/returns.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.returns.hint.status.tail', 'en-US', ' (one step to the end). "Restocked, awaiting refund" is left behind when the refund step did not finish (gateway hiccup / network drop); just retry the refund, the restock will not happen twice.', 200, 'admin', 'admin/returns.html', 1, now(), now()),
